{"availability":"available","full":"quantavil/Anidash","name":"Anidash","description":"AniDash is a modern, personal anime tracker powered by SvelteKit, Tailwind CSS v4, and the MyAnimeList API.","category":"Design","language":"Svelte","stars":5,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-19T06:16:11Z","updated":"2026-10-04T20:16:10Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://anidash.pages.dev/","topics":["anime","anime-tracker","myanimelist","myanimelist-api","myanimelist-profile"],"demo":"https://anidash.pages.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T16:23:39.474Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T16:23:39.474Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T16:23:39.474Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T16:23:39.474Z","stars":5,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AniDash is a premium, high-end personal anime tracker with a focus on Ethereal Glass aesthetics and high-performance list management. Powered by Svelte 5 (Runes), Tailwind CSS v4, and the MyAnimeList API. Current release: 0.1.3.","The original AniDash interface is restored, with the current illustrated welcome screen retained. Public visitors can explore anime before connecting MyAnimeList."],"features":["Ethereal Glass UI: A custom-crafted design system using frosted glassmorphism, fluid animations, and high-contrast OLED black themes.","Offline-First Resilience: Full IndexedDB caching for your entire watch list. Browse, check stats, and view anime details even without an internet connection.","Fused Filtering Logic: Optimized +page.svelte by consolidating chained filter calls into a single O(N) pass, reducing intermediate array allocations and GC pressure during user interaction.","Offline Sync Queue: Implemented a discrete syncQueue IndexedDB store (DBVERSION 2) to natively sequester offline or failed user mutations. Ensures offline mutations are maintained optimistically and re-attempted…","Zero-Dependency Visuals: Implemented score and media format d